  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Header.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"645\"></strong></span></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">透過<strong>解鎖打字</strong>，您可以在通常禁止使用 § 顏色和格式代碼的文字框中自由使用它們，包括：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🪧 <strong>告示牌</strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">📘 <strong>書與羽毛筆。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">⚒ <strong>鐵砧</strong>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🌍 <strong>世界名稱。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">💬 <strong>聊天。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">支援的顏色和<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fFormatting_codes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>格式代碼</strong></span></a>包括：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">§0-§f 用於顏色，§l、§o、§n、§m、§k、§r 用於格式設定。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>您需要一個伺服器來和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Promo.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"253\"></strong></a></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找一個伺服器來與朋友遊玩任何模組或模組包，<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong>就是您的解決方案！他們提供性價比最高的 Minecraft 伺服器，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></strong>並使用代碼「Lupin」，即可獲得 25% 的折扣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Description.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">解鎖打字讓您可以在通常禁止使用顏色和格式代碼（§）的文字框中自由使用它們，包括告示牌、書與羽毛筆、鐵砧、世界名稱和聊天。它支援顏色代碼 §0–§f 和格式代碼 §l、§o、§n、§m、§k 和 §r，讓您能完全自由地以獨特的顏色和樣式自訂文字。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Faq.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"169\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>它在伺服器上運作嗎？</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！它運作完美！請記住，與朋友遊玩模組的最佳方式是使用 BisectHosting，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結即可獲得 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>這個模組可以用在模組包中嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！只要僅在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上發布。將其上傳到任何其他平台將侵犯我們的權利，且完全不允許。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">然而，如果您考慮將它加入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 模組包，我們將非常感激。如果您需要任何小修改或有任何問題，請聯絡我們！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以在我的頻道上錄製這個模組的影片並展示嗎？</strong></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然，您可以自由地在您的頻道上遊玩這個模組或我們的任何模組包並製作影片，事實上，我們會非常感激！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UNLOCKED_TYPING/MP_UNLOCKED_TYPING_Screenshots.webp\" width=\"1707\" height=\"168\"></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/460/unlocked-typing-1.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/462/unlocked-typing-3.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1372/466/unlocked-typing-6.jpg\" width=\"1707\" height=\"960\"></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/A4L1r9kw9Xc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></strong></span></a></span></p>",
